<title>USA: Oshkosh Truck gets $6.9 mln Army contract.</title>
<headline>Oshkosh Truck gets $6.9 mln Army contract.</headline>
<dateline>OSHKOSH, Wis. 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Oshkosh Truck Corp said Thursday the U.S. Army Tank Automotive and Armaments Command awarded it a $6.9 million contract for Phase I of the Medium Tactical Truck Remanufacture Program.</p>
<p>It said the first phase covers design, development and production of five prototype test vehicles for the U.S. Marine Corps.</p>
<p>Five additional test vehicles for the U.S. Army are available as options under the contract.</p>
<p>-- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
